The sceptre was sealed deep within the [[Tomb of Nefertiti]] and protected by a series of deadly traps and riddles. It was eventually acquired by the [[Huntik Foundation]]. However, in order to escape [[the Organization]] forces, [[Dante Vale]] threw the sceptre into a waterfall to allow the team time to escape and it was recovered by Klaus' [[Suits]]. However Dante then revealed he had placed tracking device on the sceptre which would lead them to [[Klaus' bookshop]]. {{source|The Sceptre Deception}}

After [[Klaus]] received the sceptre and learned the Neverlost spell, he destroyed it, feeding it to his [[Klaus' spiders|spider creations]], because he had scanned the spell [[Neverlost]] into his [[Teknonomicon]]. {{source|The Bookshop Hunter}}

